    "call": "game.art_new_fake_tennille（import assets; assets.load_all(); from engine import sprite; sprite.get('fake_tennille.<动作>').frames）；原引擎绘制：engine.sprite.draw(img, 'fake_tennille.<动作>', x, y, frame=i, flip=False)"
